# Wireframe: Project List

## Purpose & Flow Context

The Project List displays all projects for the current team, updating in real-time as other team members create, update, or complete projects via WebSocket events. Entry: user navigates to Projects section. Exit: user clicks a project card to view detail, or navigates away. This screen is a container for ProjectCard components — the real-time behaviour is in the card-level animations (see project-card.wireframes); this wireframe covers the list-level layout and how real-time updates manifest at the list level.

---

## Notation Legend

| Symbol | Meaning | Symbol | Meaning |
|--------|---------|--------|---------|
| `[...]` | Button / interactive element | `[>...▼]` | Dropdown |
| `_______` | Text input / editable field | `[X]` | Close / dismiss |
| `⚠` | Warning / due date | `📎N` | N attachments |
| `💬N` | N comments | `🔗` | Card relationship |
| `👤` | User / mention | `○ ●` | Radio unselected / selected |

## Accessibility — Shared Conventions

All interactive screens inherit these. Per-screen specifics noted where they diverge.

| Concern | Convention |
|---------|------------|
| Landmarks | `header`, `main`, `aside`, `contentinfo` |
| Heading order | One `h1` per screen, `h2` for sections |
| Accessible names | Icon-only controls get `aria-label` |
| Keyboard | Tab, Enter/Space, Escape, Arrow keys |
| Target size | ≥24×24 CSS px reservation |
| Non-color intent | Icon + text, never color alone |

---

## Layout Regions

**Grid**: 12-column layout. Spacing cadence: 8px rhythm intent.

**App-shell**: Shared header + nav + container. Project List sits in the main content area.

| Region | Content | Notes |
|--------|---------|-------|
| Header | Shared app-shell header | See header-connection-status.wireframes |
| Toolbar | Search, view toggle (list/grid), "New Project" button | Below header |
| Project Grid | Grid of ProjectCard components | 3 columns on desktop, responsive |
| Empty State | When no projects | Full width in content area |

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  [Logo]   [Issues]  [Projects ▼]  [Cycles]  [● Connected] [🔔] [👤] |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  [🔍 Search___]  [▦ List] [□ Grid]                 [+ New Project] |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                    |
|  +-------------------------+ +-------------------------+ +-------+ |
|  |  🚀 Frontend Redesign  | |  📊 Analytics Dashboard | |  🎯 API | |
|  |  [===========----] 75% | |  [=========------] 55% | |  [===] 30% | |
|  |  [👤][👤][👤]          | |  [👤][👤]               | |  [👤]   | |
|  +-------------------------+ +-------------------------+ +-------+ |
|                                                                    |
|  +-------------------------+ +-------------------------+           |
|  |  🔧 Mobile App          | |  📝 Documentation Hub   |           |
|  |  [==========--------] 60% | |  [==================] 100%|           |
|  |  [👤][👤][👤][👤]      | |  [👤]                   |           |
|  +-------------------------+ +-------------------------+           |
|                                                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

*Legend: [{Button}] [Input] [Link] [>Dropdown] [Avatar] [Icon]*

## Components & Affordances

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| Search Input | Input | Filters projects by name | Debounced, min 2 chars |
| View Toggle | Button group | Switches between list and grid view | Persists preference |
| New Project Button | Button | Opens create project form/modal | Primary action |
| ProjectCard | ProjectCard | Click navigates to project detail | Real-time update animations (see project-card.wireframes) |

## Data Display

Projects are displayed in a grid (default) or list layout. Each card shows:
- Project icon
- Project name
- Progress bar with percentage
- Member avatars (stacked, shows +N if >3)

**Real-time list-level behaviour:**
- New projects (`project.created`) insert at top/start of grid with brief highlight
- Updated projects (`project.updated`) trigger card-level animations (see project-card.wireframes)
- Completed projects may move to a "Completed" section or update progress bar to 100%

## Content & Microcopy Intent

| Slot | Intent | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| Search Placeholder | Suggests search | "Search projects..." |
| View Toggle Labels | Identify view mode | "List", "Grid" icons |
| New Project Button | Creates new project | "New Project" |
| Empty State | No projects in team | "No projects yet. Create your first project to get started." |

## States

### Populated (Default)

Grid shows projects with cards.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  [🔍 Search___]  [▦ List] [□ Grid]                 [+ New Project] |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                    |
|  +-------------------------+ +-------------------------+ +-------+ |
|  |  🚀 Frontend Redesign  | |  📊 Analytics Dashboard | |  🎯 API | |
|  |  [===========----] 75% | |  [=========------] 55% | |  [===] 30% | |
|  |  [👤][👤][👤]          | |  [👤][👤]               | |  [👤]   | |
|  +-------------------------+ +-------------------------+ +-------+ |
|                                                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Updated (Real-time Event Received)

A real-time event modifies a project. The affected card highlights briefly; new projects insert at start.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  [🔍 Search___]  [▦ List] [□ Grid]                 [+ New Project] |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                    |
|  +-------------------------+ +-------------------------+ +-------+ |
|  |  🚀 Frontend Redesign  | |  📊 Analytics Dashboard | |  🎯 API | |
|  |  [===========----] 75% | |  [=======-------] 50%  | |  [===] 30% | | ← UPDATED (highlighted)
|  |  [👤][👤][👤]          | |  [👤][👤]               | |  [👤]   | |    (progress changed 55% → 50%)
|  +-------------------------+ +-------------------------+ +-------+ |
|                                                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
  (real-time event: project.updated — card highlights, progress bar updates)
```

### Loading (Initial Load or Reconnect)

Skeleton mirrors the grid layout — 3 skeleton cards with placeholder bars.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  [🔍 Search___]  [▦ List] [□ Grid]                 [+ New Project] |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                    |
|  +-------------------------+ +-------------------------+ +-------+ |
|  |  [== skeleton ====]     | |  [== skeleton ====]     | | [====] | |
|  |  [===========----]      | |  [===========----]      | | [====] | |
|  |  [👤][👤]               | |  [👤][👤]               | | [👤]   | |
|  +-------------------------+ +-------------------------+ +-------+ |
|                                                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Empty (No Projects)

Full-width empty state with guide-to-action.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  [🔍 Search___]  [▦ List] [□ Grid]                 [+ New Project] |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                    |
|                     [Icon Illustration]                           |
|                     No projects yet                                |
|                     Create your first project to get started.     |
|                     [+ Create Project]                             |
|                                                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

## Responsive

| Breakpoint | Changes |
|------------|---------|
| Desktop (>1024px) | 3-column grid, all elements visible |
| Tablet (768-1024px) | 2-column grid, sidebar hidden |
| Mobile (<768px) | Single column, cards full width, "New Project" becomes FAB |

## Accessibility — Screen Composition

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Landmarks | `main` landmark contains project grid |
| Heading order | h1: "Projects" (page title, implied) |
| Reading / Focus order | Top to bottom: Toolbar → Project cards in grid order (left-to-right, top-to-bottom) |
| Accessible names | Search: aria-label="Search projects", New Project: aria-label="Create new project", View toggle: aria-label="Switch to {view} view" |
| Keyboard operability | Tab through toolbar then cards; Enter/Space opens project; Arrow keys navigate grid |
| Target size | ≥24×24 CSS px on toolbar controls and project cards |
| Focus not obscured | Toolbar is not sticky |
| Non-color intent | Progress bar + percentage text, project icon + name |

## Assumptions

- **Existing screen**: This is an existing grid/list view receiving real-time updates. The wireframe focuses on real-time-specific behaviour (list-level insert/highlight animations).
- **Card behaviour**: Individual card-level real-time animations are defined in project-card.wireframes. This wireframe shows list-level manifestation only.
- **View toggle**: List/grid toggle is existing UI; shown here for layout context.
